---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
---
<Layout title="How Finable works — from finance scan to a clear monthly rhythm | Finable" description="No standard package. Finable starts with what's already in place, defines the scope together with you, sets up the collaboration carefully and then runs every month in a clear rhythm.">
<div style="max-width:100%;overflow-x:hidden;background:var(--white)">

  <Header active="hoe-het-werkt" />

  <!-- HERO (navy) -->
  <section class="hero-navy" style="background:var(--navy)">
    <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:72px">
    <div class="hero" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,0.96fr) minmax(0,1.04fr);gap:clamp(36px,4.4vw,68px);align-items:center">
      <div>
        <div class="lbl" style="margin-bottom:26px">How Finable works</div>
        <h1 style="font-size:clamp(36px,4.8vw,60px);line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:26px">No standard package. We start with <span class="em">your business.</span></h1>
        <p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.7vw,20px);color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);max-width:500px;text-wrap:pretty">Every finance function is different. We first look at what's already in place, what works and what's missing. From there, we decide together what Finable should take over.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-top:30px">
          <span style="width:40px;height:2px;background:var(--terracotta);flex-shrink:0"></span>
          <span style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--white)">Pragmatic. Personal. Always tailored.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="position:relative">
        <div class="hero-right" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px;align-items:center">
          <div class="tri">
            <div>
              <div class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4"/></svg></div>
              <div class="tl">What's already<br>in place?</div>
            </div>
            <svg class="ta" width="24" height="14" viewBox="0 0 30 18" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 9h24M18 2l8 7-8 7"/></svg>
            <div>
              <div class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20h16"/><rect x="6" y="11" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="11" y="7" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="16" y="13" width="3" height="4"/></svg></div>
              <div class="tl">What's<br>missing?</div>
            </div>
            <svg class="ta" width="24" height="14" viewBox="0 0 30 18" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 9h24M18 2l8 7-8 7"/></svg>
            <div>
              <div class="ic"><svg width="28" height="24" viewBox="0 0 40 34" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="20" cy="10" r="5"/><circle cx="8" cy="13" r="4"/><circle cx="32" cy="13" r="4"/><path d="M10 28c0-5 4.5-8 10-8s10 3 10 8"/></svg></div>
              <div class="tl">What should<br>Finable take over?</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-note" style="position:absolute;top:-14px;left:20%;width:170px;text-align:center;pointer-events:none">
          <div class="cav" style="font-size:22px">What works, stays.</div>
          <svg width="70" height="46" viewBox="0 0 70 46" fill="none" style="margin:2px auto 0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 6C22 30 44 38 62 30" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M55 22l8 9-13 5" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 1 · SCAN -->
  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:40px">
    <div class="scan-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="lbl" style="margin-bottom:20px">1 &nbsp;·&nbsp; We start with a scan</div>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,42px);line-height:1.08;margin-bottom:20px">First, we understand what's already there.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--body);text-wrap:pretty">We look at how finance is organised today: who does what, which systems you use, how the month-end close works and what management gets to see.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="scan-mid" style="display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center">
        <div style="flex:1">
          <div class="scan-row">
            <span class="mark" style="border:1.5px solid var(--navy)"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="#1B3A5C" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7l3.5 3.5L12 3.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:var(--navy)">Daily finance</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--body)">Invoices, transactions and administration are running smoothly.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="scan-row">
            <span class="mark" style="border:1.5px solid var(--navy)"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="#1B3A5C" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7l3.5 3.5L12 3.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:var(--navy)">Month-end close</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--body)">The process is clear and the numbers are reliable.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="scan-row">
            <span class="mark" style="border:1.5px solid var(--terracotta)"></span>
            <div><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:var(--navy)">Controlling</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--body)">There isn't enough time or expertise to properly review what is happening behind the numbers.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="scan-row">
            <span class="mark" style="border:1.5px solid var(--terracotta);color:var(--terracotta);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif">!</span>
            <div><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:var(--navy)">Reporting &amp; insight</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--body)">Management doesn't consistently get the information it needs.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-shrink:0">
          <svg width="20" height="120" viewBox="0 0 20 120" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2C6 2 6 30 3 30 6 30 6 58 14 58" transform="translate(0 2)"/><path d="M14 60C6 60 6 88 3 88 6 88 6 116 14 116"/></svg>
          <div class="cav" style="font-size:20px;max-width:96px">This is where Finable can strengthen.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,46px);color:var(--navy);line-height:1.12;margin-top:clamp(44px,5vw,68px);max-width:960px;text-wrap:balance">What works, stays. We strengthen what's missing.</h3>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 · SCOPE (soft terracotta) -->
  <section style="background:var(--terracotta-soft);margin-top:40px">
    <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:72px;padding-bottom:72px">
      <div class="scope-flex" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,0.72fr) minmax(0,1.28fr);gap:clamp(32px,4vw,64px);align-items:center">
        <div>
          <div class="lbl" style="margin-bottom:20px">2 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Together we define the scope</div>
          <h2 style="font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,42px);line-height:1.08;margin-bottom:20px">From one part to almost your entire finance function.</h2>
          <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--body);text-wrap:pretty">Finable doesn't have to take over everything at once. Together, we decide which responsibilities stay with your organisation and which become part of the Finable team's scope.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="position:relative">
          <div class="scope-labels" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:2px">
            <span class="lbl" style="letter-spacing:0.14em;color:var(--navy)">One part</span>
            <span class="lbl" style="letter-spacing:0.14em;color:var(--navy)">More responsibility</span>
            <span class="lbl" style="letter-spacing:0.14em;color:var(--navy)">Almost everything</span>
          </div>
          <div class="scope-line"><i class="hollow" style="left:0"></i><i style="left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)"></i><i style="right:0"></i></div>
          <div class="scope-split" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;margin-top:22px">
            <div style="max-width:260px">
              <div class="lbl" style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:8px">Stays with your team</div>
              <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55">The finance work you want to keep in-house or with existing partners.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="max-width:260px;text-align:right">
              <div class="lbl" style="margin-bottom:8px">Finable takes over</div>
              <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55">The recurring finance work and responsibilities that become part of the Finable team's scope.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="scope-note" style="position:absolute;top:-58px;right:8%;width:190px;text-align:center;pointer-events:none">
            <div class="cav" style="font-size:20px">It doesn't have to be all or nothing.</div>
            <svg width="60" height="42" viewBox="0 0 60 42" fill="none" style="margin:2px auto 0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M50 6C42 24 26 32 10 30" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M17 22l-7 9 12 3" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 · SETUP -->
  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:80px;padding-bottom:72px">
    <div style="max-width:680px;margin-bottom:48px">
      <div class="lbl" style="margin-bottom:20px">3 &nbsp;·&nbsp; We set up the collaboration</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,42px);line-height:1.08;margin-bottom:18px">Take over carefully. Then simply keep it running.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--body);max-width:600px;text-wrap:pretty">Once the scope is clear, we set up the collaboration around your existing organisation. We agree on responsibilities, arrange access to the right systems and make sure the Finable team has what it needs to take over the work properly.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="work-grid">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="1.5" style="flex-shrink:0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4"/></svg>
          <div><div class="lbl" style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px">Working agreements</div><p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55">Who does what, when and how we work together.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="1.5" style="flex-shrink:0" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 018 0v3"/></svg>
          <div><div class="lbl" style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px">Systems &amp; access</div><p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55">Access to the systems, information and processes the team needs.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start">
          <svg width="26" height="22" viewBox="0 0 40 34" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="1.6" style="flex-shrink:0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="20" cy="10" r="5"/><circle cx="8" cy="13" r="4"/><circle cx="32" cy="13" r="4"/><path d="M10 28c0-5 4.5-8 10-8s10 3 10 8"/></svg>
          <div><div class="lbl" style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px">Your Finable team</div><p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55">The people responsible for running the agreed finance scope.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="tl-item"><div style="position:relative"><span class="tl-dot"></span><span class="tl-line"></span></div><div><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;color:var(--navy)">Review</div><p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--body)">What's there, what's needed?</p></div></div>
        <div class="tl-item"><div style="position:relative"><span class="tl-dot"></span><span class="tl-line"></span></div><div><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;color:var(--navy)">Set up</div><p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--body)">Access, processes, team.</p></div></div>
        <div class="tl-item"><div style="position:relative"><span class="tl-dot"></span><span class="tl-line"></span></div><div><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;color:var(--navy)">Handover</div><p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--body)">Controlled, step by step.</p></div></div>
        <div class="tl-item"><div style="position:relative"><span class="tl-dot"></span><span class="tl-line"></span></div><div><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;color:var(--navy)">Operational</div><p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--body)">Then it simply runs.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 · EVERY MONTH (navy anchor) -->
  <section class="navy" style="background:var(--navy)">
    <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:84px;padding-bottom:84px">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:52px">
        <div style="max-width:640px">
          <div class="lbl" style="color:var(--terracotta);margin-bottom:20px">4 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Then, every month</div>
          <h2 style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px);color:var(--white);line-height:1.08">A clear rhythm. Every month.</h2>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--on-dark-secondary);max-width:380px;text-wrap:pretty">Once everything is running, finance becomes a recurring operational rhythm. The team does the work, closes the month, checks the numbers and turns them into reporting you can actually use.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cyc">
        <div>
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4"/></svg>
          <div class="cn">Execute</div><div class="cd">Processing &amp; administration</div>
        </div>
        <svg class="ca" width="24" height="14" viewBox="0 0 30 18" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 9h24M18 2l8 7-8 7"/></svg>
        <div>
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M4 9h16M8 3v4M16 3v4"/></svg>
          <div class="cn">Close</div><div class="cd">Month-end file &amp; checks</div>
        </div>
        <svg class="ca" width="24" height="14" viewBox="0 0 30 18" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 9h24M18 2l8 7-8 7"/></svg>
        <div>
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20h16"/><rect x="6" y="11" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="11" y="7" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="16" y="13" width="3" height="4"/></svg>
          <div class="cn">Review</div><div class="cd">Analysis &amp; variances</div>
        </div>
        <svg class="ca" width="24" height="14" viewBox="0 0 30 18" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 9h24M18 2l8 7-8 7"/></svg>
        <div>
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6"/></svg>
          <div class="cn">Report</div><div class="cd">Reporting &amp; insight</div>
        </div>
        <svg class="ca" width="24" height="14" viewBox="0 0 30 18" fill="none" stroke="#C4643A" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 9h24M18 2l8 7-8 7"/></svg>
        <div>
          <svg width="30" height="26" viewBox="0 0 40 34" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="20" cy="10" r="5"/><circle cx="8" cy="13" r="4"/><circle cx="32" cy="13" r="4"/><path d="M10 28c0-5 4.5-8 10-8s10 3 10 8"/></svg>
          <div class="cn">Discuss</div><div class="cd">Insight &amp; advice</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);margin:56px 0 40px"></div>

      <div class="navy-end" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.4fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,3.4vw,56px);align-items:end">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,42px);color:var(--white);line-height:1.12">Finance keeps running. You know what's going on.</h3>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--on-dark-secondary);margin-bottom:14px;text-wrap:pretty">No surprises, just insight. That's what we do it for.</p>
          <a href="/en/book-a-call" style="color:var(--terracotta);font-weight:600;font-size:15px">Book a call &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ESTIMATE (same component as on /en/finance-team) -->
  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:0">
    <div class="indic">
      <div>
        <div class="lbl" style="margin-bottom:14px">Estimate</div>
        <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2.2vw,28px);color:var(--navy);line-height:1.2">Get an estimate for your finance team.</p>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--body);text-wrap:pretty">Answer a few questions about your organisation and finance setup.</p>
      <Button href="/en/estimate" size="sm" style="text-align:center">Get an estimate &rarr;</Button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ + TIM (white) -->
  <section style="background:var(--white);margin-top:8px">
    <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:68px;padding-bottom:68px">
    <div class="endmod" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,0.9fr);gap:clamp(40px,5vw,72px);align-items:start">
      <div>
        <div class="lbl" style="margin-bottom:28px">Frequently asked questions</div>
        <details class="fin-faq"><summary><span class="fin-faq-q">Do you always take over our entire finance function?</span><span class="fin-faq-ic"></span></summary><div class="fin-faq-a"><p>No. Finable can start with one part of your finance operation or take over almost the entire day-to-day function. We first look at what's already working and then define a scope that makes sense for your organisation.</p></div></details>
        <details class="fin-faq"><summary><span class="fin-faq-q">What happens to our existing bookkeeper or accountant?</span><span class="fin-faq-ic"></span></summary><div class="fin-faq-a"><p>That depends on your current setup. If an existing partner still has a useful role, they don't automatically need to disappear. We define clearly who is responsible for what and make sure the different parts of finance work together.</p></div></details>
        <details class="fin-faq"><summary><span class="fin-faq-q">Do we need to switch systems?</span><span class="fin-faq-ic"></span></summary><div class="fin-faq-a"><p>Not necessarily. We start with the tools and processes you already use. What works can stay. If a change would materially improve the way finance operates, we'll discuss it during the setup.</p></div></details>
        <details class="fin-faq"><summary><span class="fin-faq-q">How does the handover work?</span><span class="fin-faq-ic"></span></summary><div class="fin-faq-a"><p>Once the scope is agreed, we map responsibilities, arrange access and collect the information the team needs. We then transfer the work in a structured way before it becomes part of the recurring Finable operation.</p></div></details>
        <div data-faq-hidden style="display:none">
          <details class="fin-faq"><summary><span class="fin-faq-q">Who do we contact when we have a question?</span><span class="fin-faq-ic"></span></summary><div class="fin-faq-a"><p>You have a fixed point of contact who knows your organisation and keeps the collaboration connected. You don't have to work out which person in the finance team handles which part of the work.</p></div></details>
          <details class="fin-faq"><summary><span class="fin-faq-q">Can the scope change later?</span><span class="fin-faq-ic"></span></summary><div class="fin-faq-a"><p>Yes. The scope can grow as your organisation changes. You might start with day-to-day finance and month-end close, for example, and add controlling or reporting and insight later when the need arises.</p></div></details>
          <details class="fin-faq"><summary><span class="fin-faq-q">How quickly can Finable get started?</span><span class="fin-faq-ic"></span></summary><div class="fin-faq-a"><p>That depends on the current setup and the scope being transferred. A relatively straightforward finance operation can naturally be handed over more easily than a complex setup involving several entities, systems or existing partners. We determine the approach after the initial scan.</p></div></details>
        </div>
        <div data-faq-morewrap style="margin-top:26px">
          <a href="#" data-faq-more style="font-weight:600;font-size:15px;color:var(--terracotta)">See all frequently asked questions &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:clamp(28px,3vw,48px)">
        <div class="lbl" style="margin-bottom:20px">Personal introduction</div>
        <div class="tim-row" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:clamp(120px,14vw,150px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:24px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:24px">
          <div style="aspect-ratio:1/1;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden"><img src="/images/tim-samsom.webp" alt="Tim Samsom, founder of Finable" width="800" height="699" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block"></div>
          <div>
            <h2 style="font-size:clamp(21px,2.2vw,28px);line-height:1.12;margin-bottom:12px">Curious what this could look like for your organisation?</h2>
            <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--body);text-wrap:pretty">Book 30 minutes with Tim to talk through how your finance is organised today and what Finable could take over.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:20px">
          <Button href="/en/book-a-call">Book a call &rarr;</Button>
